(8\) PPO objective terms) Tj
0 -14 Td
(ratio = exp\(log_pi_new - log_pi_old\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(unclipped = ratio * A_t) Tj
0 -14 Td
(clipped = clip\(ratio, 1-eps, 1+eps\) * A_t) Tj
0 -14 Td
(actor_loss = -mean\( min\(unclipped, clipped\) \)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(actor objective = actor_loss - entropy_coef * entropy) Tj
0 -14 Td
(critic_loss = mean\(\(V\(s_t\)-value_target_t\)^2\)) Tj
0 -14 Td
(critic objective = value_loss_coef * critic_loss) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Source: ppo_training/trainer.py 329-340, 348-351.) Tj
